BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Begotten (1989)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261028T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261028T203500
DTSTAMP:20261029T020000Z
UID:begotten-4k-restoration-2026-10-28-19:00:00-07:00
DESCRIPTION:“Begotten” has no characters in the ordinary sense. Its fi
 nal credits name three principal figures:\n\nGod Killing Himself.\nMother 
 Earth.\nSon of Earth — Flesh on Bone\n\nThe entire film is what those na
 mes do to each other and to the earth. God Killing Himself tears open his 
 body and dies. Mother Earth rises from what remains and takes his seed int
 o herself. She gives birth to Son of Earth — Flesh on Bone. He is cast i
 nto a barren world\, seized by the Nomads\, tortured\, killed\, and briefl
 y returned to life by his mother. The Nomads destroy her too. The Robed Fi
 gures gather what remains of mother and son\, grind their bodies down\, an
 d return them to the soil. The ground flowers.\n\nE. Elias Merhige\, Unite
 d States\, 1989\, 72 min\, English intertitles\n\nhttps://nwfilmforum.org/
 films/begotten-4k-restoration/\n\nEstimated start: 19:20
LOCATION:Northwest Film Forum\, 1515 12th Ave\, Seattle\, WA 98122
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Castration Movie Chapter iii. Junior Ghosts—Premorphic Drift\; a
  fragmentary passage
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T180000
DTSTAMP:20261101T233000Z
UID:castration-movie-chapter-iii-ii-junior-ghosts-premorphic-drift-a-fragm
 entary-passage-2026-11-01-15:30:00-08:00
DESCRIPTION:Castration Movie is a multi-part postmodern epic by visionary 
 auteur Louise Weard. In Chapter iii. Junior Ghosts—Premorphic Drift\, Iz
 zy (Avalon Fast) seeks out everything in her power to stop her partner (He
 nri Gillespi) from transitioning.\n\nLouise Weard\, Canada\, 2026\, 126 mi
 n\, in English\n\nhttps://nwfilmforum.org/films/castration-movie-chapter-i
 ii-ii-junior-ghosts-premorphic-drift-a-fragmentary-passage/\n\nEstimated s
 tart: 15:50
LOCATION:Northwest Film Forum\, 1515 12th Ave\, Seattle\, WA 98122
END:VEVENT
