SUMMARY:Jennifer's Body (2009)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261027T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261027T211000
DTSTAMP:20261028T020000Z
UID:jennifers-body-2026-10-27-19:00:00-07:00
DESCRIPTION:Megan Fox stars in this horror-comedy about a high school chee
 rleader who develops an insatiable appetite for her male classmates after 
 she’s possessed by a hungry demon.\n\nKaryn Kusama\, 2009\, United State
 s\, 107 min\, in English\n\nhttps://nwfilmforum.org/films/jennifers-body/
 \n\nEstimated start: 19:20
LOCATION:Northwest Film Forum\, 1515 12th Ave\, Seattle\, WA 98122
END:VEVENT
