SUMMARY:Zero Patience (1993)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261202T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261202T213000
DTSTAMP:20261203T033000Z
UID:zero-patience-2026-12-02-19:30:00-08:00
DESCRIPTION:To commemorate World AIDS Day 2026\, Northwest Film Forum is e
 xcited to present John Greyson’s movie musical Zero Patience. Unconventi
 onal (and fun!) in form and incredibly imaginative in its premise\, Zero P
 atience is a film that confronts historical bigotry and damaging myths tha
 t surround the mysterious (and patently fictional) “Patient Zero” whil
 e also remaining campy\, educational\, and ambitious.\n\nJohn Greyson\, Un
 ited States\, 1993\, 97 min\, in English\n\nhttps://nwfilmforum.org/films/
 zero-patience/\n\nEstimated start: 19:50
LOCATION:Northwest Film Forum\, 1515 12th Ave\, Seattle\, WA 98122
END:VEVENT
